BRUHsailer Ironman guide
------------------------
By So Iron BRUH and ParasailerOSRS.
  Interactive guide: https://umkyzn.github.io/BRUHsailer/
  OSRS Wiki page:    https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Guide:BRUHsailer

Stepwise follows the BRUHsailer route. The side panel shows the guide's original text, and the
step breakdown, items needed and budget figures are built from the guide and its budget ledger.
All rights to the guide remain with its authors.


