RuneLite
--------
https://github.com/runelite/runelite

Stepwise's bird house tracking is derived from RuneLite's Time Tracking plugin code, and its
achievement diary varbit ids come from the Varbits table. Stepwise also reads game state the
way these RuneLite plugins do, and its comments cite them: Kingdom of Miscellania (dating the
kingdom's values by when they last changed), Slayer (reading the task once its vars settle,
and the Slayer master varbit) and Rune Pouch (the pouch's rune and quantity varbits). The Java
file derived from the Time Tracking code keeps its upstream notices:

